## flutter test（R4-07 合同）

```
> flutter test test/r4_07_contract_test.dart --reporter expanded

RUN 1: All tests passed!
RUN 2: All tests passed!
RUN 3: All tests passed!
RUN 4: context menu lifecycle and captured target - did not complete [E]   (flutter_tester exit -1073741819 / exit 79)
RUN 5: did not complete [E]
